By unanimous consent the public body may designate noncontroversial items to be considered in one motion and one vote.  The public body may add items from the regular agenda and approve. Posted agenda items not added to the consent docket will be considered separately in their regular order.  Staff recommends that Item (A) through Item (C) be placed on the consent agenda. The Mayor does not vote on this consent agenda as these are his nominations.
